{"type":"node","id":"task005","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-005 init --template 骨架派生","description":"skeletonLines 接入 init：替代 cp 模版工作流，schema 成为唯一事实源","content":"【实现说明】init 增加 --template 选项；骨架节点构造复用 node/changelog 行逻辑；metadata.template 在建包时写入\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN user-stories schema WHEN dtp init 名 --template <schema> THEN 生成包 skeleton 节点 id/type/title 与 schema 一致、无示例业务节点、metadata.template 记录齐备，且 verify 全绿、lint 通过","GIVEN --id 与 skeleton id 冲突 WHEN init --template THEN USAGE 报错且不落盘","GIVEN 坏 schema WHEN init --template THEN 拒绝并提示先 dtp template check"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.101Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.101Z","version":1,"hash":"1a5c71e70abfeb88072c57e2d9fca2bc115c0e0be684a76637fae89bca239b5b","tags":["task","template"],"status":"draft"}
