{"type":"node","id":"task008","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-008 回归测试与文档/技能同步","description":"test/template-edges.test.js 等边界用例；技能与模板文档同步（AGENTS.md 技能新鲜度要求）","content":"【实现说明】测试边界清单见 US-002 背景与 dev 评审；文档同步范围：两技能 SKILL.md、docs/templates/README.md、必要时 AGENTS.md\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P2","acceptance":["GIVEN npm test THEN 全绿，且新增测试覆盖：空容器全新包 lint 通过、正则运行时异常捕获成 violation、ext 类型 string/array 语义、ref_exists 全等匹配、bind 后 re-bind 升级","GIVEN 功能合入 WHEN 核对技能新鲜度 THEN user-stories/dtp-regression 技能与 docs/templates/README.md 已更新，dtp verify 通过且 package.json 版本已 bump"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.212Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.212Z","version":1,"hash":"985d88df3c39c5ccb6e625a926efc0e5c3240a02f35ef85302595f3af245317f","tags":["task","template"],"status":"draft"}
