{"type":"node","id":"task011","parent_id":"us003","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-011 webui 入仓纠正与 dtp web 接线","description":"import 重指 ../src、server start() 化、workspace 链对齐 .dtp 约定、夹具处置（截图保留不入包）","content":"【实现说明】import 直启不 spawn；webui/package.json 子包声明删除（随主包分发）；api.js 直接 import 引擎是特性保留\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-003","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 仓库内加载 webui/api.js THEN 无 doctree-packet-cli 残留引用（13 处 import 重指 ../src/*）","server.js 重构 export start({host,port,workspace})+直跑守卫；dtp web 命令 import 直启，--port/--host/--open/--dir 可用，--open 缺省不开浏览器","GIVEN workspace 解析链 --dir > DTP_WORKSPACE > .dtp/config.json 存在→.dtp/ > 报错指引 init THEN 四态可测","webui/workspace/ 与 webui/docs/ .dtp 副本删除；gui-test-screenshots/ 保留不入包；test-template.mjs/test-write.mjs 改写 node:test 并入 test/ 后删原文件","dtp web 启动后树/查询/编辑 API 冒烟全过（复用改写用例断言）"]},"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:39:45.130Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:39:45.130Z","version":1,"hash":"720a3c458872cbfd024f83fab2749f6b7b6ae00dfc9342bbf7ef164b14bb228f","tags":["task","packaging","webui"],"status":"draft"}
