{"type":"node","id":"task012","parent_id":"us003","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-012 打包工程（files 白名单 + 发布闸门）","description":"files 白名单锁定分发内容；隐私红线回归自动化；发布闸门前置","content":"【实现说明】files 白名单是排除的天然效果（webui/workspace 等物理处置由 TASK-011 完成后白名单双保险）；npm pack --json 断言测试入主套件\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-003","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN package.json files 白名单 THEN npm pack --json 清单含 bin/src/README/LICENSE/docs/templates/webui 运行文件/playbook，且逐项断言不含 test/、docs/*.dtp、AGENTS.md、webui/workspace、gui-test-screenshots、*.mjs（断言测试自动化防回潮）","prepublishOnly=npm test：GIVEN 测试失败 WHEN 走 pack 途径 THEN 被拒（dry 途径验证不真 publish）","README 新增安装章节：npm i -g <tgz> 现状方式 + 发布后 npx 标注"]},"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:39:45.171Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:32:14.484Z","version":2,"hash":"00966a74896149e636d2129f06297e829d1fbf8608dfdb75e5afa3a792d37dcf","tags":["task","packaging"],"status":"review"}
